: [{"description": "#TSMC #CoWoS #메모리컨트롤러 #HBM #베이스다이 #메모리 #반도체 #인포마켓 #강용운 #마이크론 #삼성전자 ...", "display_url": "youtu.be/ZmuOlQQmB0U", "end": 69, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/ZmuOlQQmB0U", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113635402263465984/1PeyV6nE?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113635402263465984/1PeyV6nE?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 46, "status": 200, "title": "CoWoS에 메모리컨트롤러를 넣겠다 - TSMC의 야욕 | 인포마켓 강용운 대표", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZmuOlQQmB0U&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/i11j7rSkmP"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Es6kMKh7cz", "end": 164, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yongwoonkang/status/2113635396664062137/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113635236072570880", "start": 141, "url": "https://t.co/Es6kMKh7cz"}]}, "id": "2113635396664062137", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 411, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CoWoS에 메모리컨트롤러를 넣겠다 - TSMC의 야욕 | 인포마켓 강용운 대표 \nhttps://t.co/i11j7rSkmP\n\n공개 영상입니다\n\n#TSMC #CoWoS #HBM #메모리컨트롤러 #마이크론 #삼성전자 #SK하이닉스 #인포마켓 #강용운대표 https://t.co/Es6kMKh7cz", "url": "https://x.com/yongwoonkang/status/2113635396664062137"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113347544075862016"]}, "author_id": "1810557309426552832", "created_at": "2026-10-24T05:14:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113861543670513989"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/V6RAb3VINf", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/long_term_pick/status/2113861543670513989/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113347544075862016", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/V6RAb3VINf"}]}, "id": "2113861543670513989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Outer Ninth scored 32 parts of the AI supply chain from 1 (ample) to 9 (severe). 16 of them score 8 or 9, and the shortages are not only in chips: HBM, server DRAM, hard drives, ABF substrates, lasers, gas turbines, and transformers all get a 9.\n\nSome names show up in more than https://t.co/V6RAb3VINf", "url": "https://x.com/long_term_pick/status/2113861543670513989"}, {"author_id": "2113552859514155008", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:39:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113656548400439628"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/17451060827903…", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/1745106082790318080/status/2113601678469468327", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/231C5Vhfe9"}]}, "id": "2113656548400439628", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113601678469468327", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Hybrid bonding is already the quiet governor on next-gen HBM densification.\n\nIf ASML is building a tool via patents (not a product announcement yet), that signals how scarce the step has become — and why stacking cadence can slip toward 2029+ while CoWoS/ABF stay tight earlier in https://t.co/231C5Vhfe9", "url": "https://x.com/Serenity_Re0/status/2113656548400439628"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113741055682043904"]}, "author_id": "1952481535225208832", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:15:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113741063554998709"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/OGM46dgctB", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lymr342980/status/2113741063554998709/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113741055682043904", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/OGM46dgctB"}]}, "id": "2113741063554998709", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 488, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "اندماج تسلا وسبيس إكس\n\nنبض صحف ومراكز\n\nالصحف التقطت الخيط بسرعة وانقسمت. بلومبرغ وباركليز وجي بي مورغان رأت الصفقة حتمية ومنطقها متماسك، فالشركتان تشتركان في المواهب الهندسية ومصنع الرقائق Terafab وفلسفة ماسك، والقيمة المجمعة قد تصل إلى 3.7 تريليون دولار، وقد يعلنها ماسك قبل https://t.co/OGM46dgctB", "url": "https://x.com/lymr342980/status/2113741063554998709"}, {"author_id": "2054325644478038016", "created_at": "2026-10-23T23:11:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113770200487354476"], "id": "2113770200487354476", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "냉정하게 말해봅시다.\n향후 5년, 반도체로 부자 되려면 어디에 묻어야 할까요?\n\n​🇺🇸 미국 반도체 (엔비디아, TSMC, ASML)\n• 압도적 기술 독점과 가격 결정권\n• 높은 밸류에이션, 하지만 실적으로 증명\n\n​🇰🇷 한국 반도체 (삼성전자, SK하이닉스)\n• AI 시대의 필수재 HBM 과점\n• 역사적 저평가 구간", "url": "https://x.com/toozy_official/status/2113770200487354476"}, {"article": {"title": "Beyond Taiwan, NVIDIA Builds Its Second Packaging Hub in Korea: 6 Advanced-Packaging Stocks"}, "author_id": "2049285786575474688", "created_at": "2026-10-23T10:57:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113585607033454601"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2113…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2113457294189252608", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2113457294189252608", "url": "https://t.co/GphJdhdjMf"}]}, "id": "2113585607033454601", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/GphJdhdjMf", "url": "https://x.com/GoBull_markets/status/2113585607033454601"}, {"article": {"title": "7-21. 番外編1：世界AI半導体・AIインフラ企業を読む"}, "author_id": "1213770526142844928", "created_at": "2026-10-24T12:31:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113971606410436811"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2113…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2113614153692684288", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2113614153692684288", "url": "https://t.co/uu0BjZMK8w"}]}, "id": "2113971606410436811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1025, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/uu0BjZMK8w", "url": "https://x.com/KagawaTomo/status/2113971606410436811"}, {"article": {"title": "輝達預付 41 億美元（這週新增 24 億），CoWoS 的缺口搬到 2027 和 2028 "}, "author_id": "380820651", "created_at": "2026-10-24T01:20:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113802681257267312"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2113…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2113660003374788608", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2113660003374788608", "url": "https://t.co/y5WfrdBJUM"}]}, "id": "2113802681257267312", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2481, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "https://t.co/y5WfrdBJUM", "url": "https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2113802681257267312"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113873123984683008"]}, "author_id": "785856172209373184", "created_at": "2026-10-24T06:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113873127256264942"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Hnx3YhTJv9", "end": 307, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2113873127256264942/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113873123984683008", "start": 284, "url": "https://t.co/Hnx3YhTJv9"}]}, "id": "2113873127256264942", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 72, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "☕ La semaine IA &amp; semi-conducteurs en 10 points ↓\n\n1) Nvidia — commandes chinoises de 3 M d’unités RTX PRO 5500 (~35 Md$)\n\nReuters révèle que ByteDance, Alibaba et Tencent ont passé des commandes dépassant 3 millions de cartes RTX PRO 5500, pour un prix affiché total &gt;35 Md$, https://t.co/Hnx3YhTJv9", "url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2113873127256264942"}, {"author_id": "2033827512028172290", "created_at": "2026-10-23T06:09:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113512996928385255"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 10, "start": 6, "tag": "TSM"}]}, "id": "2113512996928385255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC ($TSM) supply chain update:\n\nTSMC has officially guided a 70% CAGR for its advanced 2nm and next-generation A16 (1.6nm) nodes through 2028.\n\nKey dynamic: For the first time in foundry history, AI hyperscalers and GPU designers (NVIDIA, AMD) will be the first-wave adopters of", "url": "https://x.com/BottleneckHQ/status/2113512996928385255"}, {"author_id": "2113552859514155008", "created_at": "2026-10-24T11:18:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113953380670246968"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/2588345408/sta…", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/2588345408/status/2113937253458432455", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/bATkNDcodA"}]}, "id": "2113953380670246968", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113937253458432455", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Micron’s deck: HBM4 at 2.8 TB/s per stack; memory/GPU up 3.6x H100→B300; “vertical HBM” eyed for 2028 (targets, not commits).\n\nNear-term AI packages still hitch to side-by-side HBM + CoWoS/ABF lead times. Stacking DRAM on the logic die shifts the bind to 3D bonding yield and https://t.co/bATkNDcodA", "url": "https://x.com/Serenity_Re0/status/2113953380670246968"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113555674118680576", "3_2113555750740209664", "3_2113555852066226176"]}, "author_id": "2029358622426402816", "created_at": "2026-10-23T08:59:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113555983683490130"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/m8RKRbNfe3", "end": 309, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/HiveIntelligent/status/2113555983683490130/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113555674118680576", "start": 286, "url": "https://t.co/m8RKRbNfe3"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/m8RKRbNfe3", "end": 309, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/HiveIntelligent/status/2113555983683490130/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113555750740209664", "start": 286, "url": "https://t.co/m8RKRbNfe3"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/m8RKRbNfe3", "end": 309, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/HiveIntelligent/status/2113555983683490130/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113555852066226176", "start": 286, "url": "https://t.co/m8RKRbNfe3"}]}, "id": "2113555983683490130", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Morgan Stanley Takeaways: HBM de-spec may lift Nvidia chip volumes\n\n&gt; AI HBM consumption could reach up to 50bn Gb in 2027 on estimates, even if Rubin Ultra may adopt tiered HBM specs. Less memory per chip could mean more chips shipped.\n\n&gt; Total implied AI chip shipments come to https://t.co/m8RKRbNfe3", "url": "https://x.com/HiveIntelligent/status/2113555983683490130"}, {"author_id": "2051301147357687808", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:32:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114002207104520614"], "id": "2114002207104520614", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Why are AI chips still so hard to get if silicon is everywhere? \n\nIt’s not a lack of sand or raw silicon.\n\nTSMC's bleeding-edge wafer fabs take years and billions to build.\n\nAdvanced packaging (CoWoS) is a massive structural bottleneck.\n\nHigh-Bandwidth Memory (HBM) supply lines", "url": "https://x.com/Nikitas10/status/2114002207104520614"}, {"author_id": "2113552859514155008", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:58:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113646369831276747"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/18133746378685…", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/1813374637868560384/status/2113570753765663221", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/2dREra8f9N"}]}, "id": "2113646369831276747", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113570753765663221", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Keep an eye on the substrate lag, not just wafer starts.\n\nUnimicron’s chair: denser/larger packages force new ABF plants, tools, and cleanliness standards per TSMC node generation — roughly ~18 AI ABF factories needed before 2030 vs TSMC’s planned fab wave.\n\nConstraint stack: ABF https://t.co/2dREra8f9N", "url": "https://x.com/Serenity_Re0/status/2113646369831276747"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113752380382593024"]}, "author_id": "246457098", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:00:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113752384061018602"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "ow.ly/XGFe50ZQgGH", "end": 277, "expanded_url": "https://ow.ly/XGFe50ZQgGH", "start": 254, "unwound_url": "https://www.chipestimate.com/GUC-Announces-2nm-16-Gbps-HBM4E-IP/GUC/news/59644", "url": "https://t.co/ChXFPjZGdb"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/dzWqvdXFhm", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/chipestimate/status/2113752384061018602/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113752380382593024", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/dzWqvdXFhm"}]}, "id": "2113752384061018602", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 210, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "GUC Announces 2nm 16 Gbps HBM4E IP\nIts HBM4E PHY and Controller IP is design-ready and has been adopted in customer AI ASICs. Implemented on TSMC’s cutting-edge N2P process, the HBM4E PHY has successfully taped out on TSMC CoWoS®-L advanced packaging... https://t.co/ChXFPjZGdb https://t.co/dzWqvdXFhm", "url": "https://x.com/chipestimate/status/2113752384061018602"}, {"author_id": "2113552859514155008", "created_at": "2026-10-23T10:01:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113571590839656606"], "id": "2113571590839656606", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What this account does:\n\nI track AI hardware supply chain bottlenecks in real time — capacity, lead times, yield issues, and key supplier moves.\n\nFocus areas:\n• Advanced packaging (CoWoS / similar)\n• HBM &amp; high-end memory\n• Optics / CPO / lasers\n• Substrates &amp; materials\n•", "url": "https://x.com/Serenity_Re0/status/2113571590839656606"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113576286975336448"]}, "author_id": "1712521226076434432", "created_at": "2026-10-23T10:20:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113576341916483907"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ADfxUd17jf", "end": 193, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/21cm142GHz/status/2113576341916483907/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113576286975336448", "start": 170, "url": "https://t.co/ADfxUd17jf"}]}, "id": "2113576341916483907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🍥従来：分離が最適\nCPU用DDR → レイテンシ（応答速度）重視\nGPU用GDDR/HBM → 帯域（秒間転送量）重視\n↓↓↓\n🍥2020年代：AI用に統合\n① CoWoS / Foveros等の先端パッケージングで、CPU-GPU間を超広帯域に繋げることが可能に\n② AIでボトルネックが「計算速度」から「メモリの壁・コピーの時間」に https://t.co/ADfxUd17jf", "url": "https://x.com/21cm142GHz/status/2113576341916483907"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113860981163974656", "3_2113860981151412224", "3_2113860981180747776", "3_2113860981210091520"]}, "author_id": "1650268779786452992", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:01:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113994170331214296"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kcizBRqWiT", "end": 308, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pequityresearch/status/2113994170331214296/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113860981163974656", "start": 285, "url": "https://t.co/kcizBRqWiT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/kcizBRqWiT", "end": 308, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pequityresearch/status/2113994170331214296/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113860981151412224", "start": 285, "url": "https://t.co/kcizBRqWiT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/kcizBRqWiT", "end": 308, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pequityresearch/status/2113994170331214296/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113860981180747776", "start": 285, "url": "https://t.co/kcizBRqWiT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/kcizBRqWiT", "end": 308, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pequityresearch/status/2113994170331214296/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113860981210091520", "start": 285, "url": "https://t.co/kcizBRqWiT"}]}, "id": "2113994170331214296", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 97, "impression_count": 13647, "like_count": 115, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "Expert Takeaways: TSMC\n\n1. CoWoS Capacity, Fab Breakdown, Spill‑Over Orders &amp; Customer Allocation\n\nCapacity Expansion: TSMC's internal CoWoS monthly capacity is targeted to reach 130k wafers by end-2026, with a long-term goal of 260k wafers/month by 2028 (excluding OSAT volumes). https://t.co/kcizBRqWiT", "url": "https://x.com/pequityresearch/status/2113994170331214296"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113996503215902721"]}, "author_id": "500779282", "created_at": "2026-10-24T14:17:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113998194329715046"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/WwzSR0wtqX", "end": 210, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/what_going_on_X/status/2113998194329715046/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113996503215902721", "start": 187, "url": "https://t.co/WwzSR0wtqX"}, {"display_url": "x.com/pequityresearc…", "end": 234, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/pequityresearch/status/2113994170331214296", "start": 211, "url": "https://t.co/IWhbE0I0i9"}]}, "id": "2113998194329715046", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113994170331214296", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "TSMC 첨단 패키징(CoWoS) 생산능력이 2년 안에 두 배로 늘어난다는 업계 전문가 인터뷰 정리가 나옴. 회사 공식 발표가 아니라 전문가 발언 기준.\n\n[CoWoS]\n- 자체 월 생산능력 목표: 2026년 말 13만 장 → 2028년 26만 장(외주 OSAT 제외)\n- 수요는 연초보다 최소 26% 증가\n- 고객별 배분: 엔비디아 https://t.co/WwzSR0wtqX https://t.co/IWhbE0I0i9", "url": "https://x.com/what_going_on_X/status/2113998194329715046"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113667352915238912"]}, "author_id": "1575826398518075392", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:22:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113667417209766256"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 155, "start": 152, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 160, "start": 156, "tag": "半導體"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/vmDeUXxqrA", "end": 184, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/hsiaoniachi/status/2113667417209766256/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113667352915238912", "start": 161, "url": "https://t.co/vmDeUXxqrA"}]}, "id": "2113667417209766256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI 半導體供應鏈，每層各在做什麼？3 分鐘看懂\n\n一台 AI 伺服器能動起來，背後要經過數層供應鏈：從雲端投資、晶片設計，一路到封裝、光通訊和電力。\n這支 3D 影片一層一層講它的應用和重要性，紅色是目前最緊的瓶頸：HBM、CoWoS 封裝、光通訊、電力散熱。\n\n影片產出來自 AI\n聲音都出自 AI\n#AI #半導體 https://t.co/vmDeUXxqrA", "url": "https://x.com/hsiaoniachi/status/2113667417209766256"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113752081454526464", "3_2113752081462865920", "3_2113752081496506368"]}, "author_id": "1650268779786452992", "created_at": "2026-10-24T00:14:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113786046060327413"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Y2BurXR9Id", "end": 306, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pequityresearch/status/2113786046060327413/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113752081454526464", "start": 283, "url": "https://t.co/Y2BurXR9Id"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Y2BurXR9Id", "end": 306, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pequityresearch/status/2113786046060327413/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113752081462865920", "start": 283, "url": "https://t.co/Y2BurXR9Id"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Y2BurXR9Id", "end": 306, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pequityresearch/status/2113786046060327413/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113752081496506368", "start": 283, "url": "https://t.co/Y2BurXR9Id"}]}, "id": "2113786046060327413", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 10213, "like_count": 85, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "InP, CoWoS/CoPoS, Silicon Wafers\n\nInP:\n\n&gt; Supply capacity is about 60–75 million wafers, while demand reaches 260–300 million, a supply gap of over 70%.\n\n&gt; Production MOCVD tools have a ~1.5-year wait, with delivery lead times of 16–22 months. Only 3–4 suppliers worldwide, so https://t.co/Y2BurXR9Id", "url": "https://x.com/pequityresearch/status/2113786046060327413"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113976501955960832", "3_2113976502429818880"]}, "author_id": "1878424909476761600", "created_at": "2026-10-24T13:00:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113978851906986137"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/NTdE4Boqff", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2113978851906986137/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113976501955960832", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/NTdE4Boqff"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/NTdE4Boqff", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/vm3jp6u04/status/2113978851906986137/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113976502429818880", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/NTdE4Boqff"}]}, "id": "2113978851906986137", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CoWoS-S: logic chips and HBM side by side on one whole silicon interposer, linked by fine wires on the silicon. Tech Daily | 9/16\n\nMade since 2012, it grew from ~1x to ~3x reticle (~2,500 mm²) by 2021. TSMC's limit now: ~3.3x (~2,700 mm²); past that, CoWoS-R or L. More in reply. http